Rust dependencies
-----------------
Package names, versions, license expressions and original license files are
included in licenses/rust/. The accompanying source archive includes vendored
sources from Cargo.lock, with their original notices. The inventory can include
build-time and other-target dependencies, not only runtime code.
zune-core 0.4.12 and zune-jpeg 0.4.21 declare MIT OR Apache-2.0 OR Zlib in
Cargo.toml/source headers but omit separate license text files from their crates.
Their original declarations/headers and the standard Apache-2.0 license text
(from /usr/share/common-licenses/Apache-2.0) are included without inventing
copyright holders.

System libraries and tools
--------------------------
Shared multimedia/graphics libraries, Python, FFmpeg and PulseAudio utilities
are dependencies supplied by the operating system; their binaries are not
bundled in this package. Their notices remain in their respective OS packages.
